   $q$How does the final paragraph shape the overall explanation?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It introduces a new kind of code that does not use check digits.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"not-in-text"},{"text":"It contradicts paragraph 1 by claiming that typing errors cannot be caught.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It admits the limits of check digits while restating their value, giving a balanced answer to the problem raised in paragraph 1.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It argues that people should check every number twice instead of relying on check digits.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It admits the limits of check digits while restating their value, giving a balanced answer to the problem raised in paragraph 1.$q$, $q$The ending concedes that check digits cannot fix errors or catch every one, but stresses they stop "a large share of everyday slips," answering the slip-of-the-finger problem from the opening. It qualifies, rather than reverses, the earlier claims.$q$, 'draft', 'f0a349e6-6e78-55ad-ac86-6916d81097b2')
