  ('b886a000-c5c7-5272-bae7-b243a174cf50', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g11-theme-summary'), null, 'medium',
   $q$How does the first paragraph set up the idea that the theme will challenge?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows Priya measuring success by a single number that she chases alone.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It explains that Priya's coach expects her to win the state meet.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It describes the pine woods and hills of the Harlow Ridge course.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"setting-not-theme"},{"text":"It reveals that Priya and Simone have been close friends for years.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It shows Priya measuring success by a single number that she chases alone.$q$, $q$The circled number, the beeping watch, and the word "alone" establish the view of success the ending revises. The course description comes in the second paragraph and gives setting, not the belief being tested.$q$, 'draft', '84cd6bc4-cabe-557e-b99a-2929b048090e')
