   $q$What does the shared half of an orange suggest about how the relationship between the two runners develops?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It suggests that Simone is still angry that Priya stopped to help her.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"},{"text":"It suggests their distant rivalry is quietly turning into a real connection.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It shows that the two girls immediately decide to train together every day.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"adds-false-detail"},{"text":"It shows that Simone feels she owes Priya a reward and wants to repay her.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It suggests their distant rivalry is quietly turning into a real connection.$q$, $q$Before the race they only "nodded" and studied results; afterward Simone seeks Priya out and shares food, a small sign of closeness. The passage says nothing about future training plans.$q$, 'draft', '84cd6bc4-cabe-557e-b99a-2929b048090e')
